     "heading": "RFdiffusion",
     "level": 3,
     "prose": "RFdiffusion is diffusion model that can be used for de novo structure design and binder design. It can be used with our [`Query`](#openprotein.prompt.Query) interface to define structure prediction objectives in a unified manner. It also supports taking in the ``contigs`` defined in official RFdiffusion repo.",
     "entries": [
