    {
     "heading": "BoltzGen",
     "level": 3,
     "prose": "BoltzGen is a structure generation model that can be used for generating de novo structures along with nanobody scaffolds. It can be used with our [`Query`](#openprotein.prompt.Query) interface to define structure prediction objectives in a unified manner. It also supports taking in a ``design_spec`` which follows the official design specification from BoltzGen.",
     "entries": [
      {
